## Placeholder metadata
- Title: The Bravyi-Kitaev transformation for quantum computation of electronic structure
- Authors: Jacob T. Seeley, Martin J. Richard, Peter J. Love
- Journal: The Journal of Chemical Physics, 137, 224109 (2012)
- Extends: Bravyi & Kitaev, "Fermionic quantum computation," Ann. Phys. 298, 210 (2002).

## Sections referenced by the replication
- Sect. II–III: parity, occupation-number, BK bases; matrices β_n, π_n.
- Sect. IV: creation/annihilation operators in the BK basis.
- Sect. V–VI: parity/update/flip sets P_j, U_j, F_j.
- Sect. VII: H2 in STO-3G; Eqs. 79 (H_JW) and 80 (H_BK) Pauli coefficients.
- Sect. VIII: Trotter-step gate counts; IPEA convergence (Fig. 5, not re-run).

